      "recommended_action": "Derive both values from one admitted matrix, or bind and validate source dimensions/content plus kernel annihilation and independence before asserting a common-source certificate."
    },
    {
      "id": "RLA-F02",
      "statement": "ExactRepairSpace counts an arbitrary supplied vector list as rank without checking independence or rectangular shape. Two copies of (1,0) are stored with rank2 although their span has dimension1.",
