      "limits": "Public metadata path only. This does not bypass the separate private ExactRepair residual replay.",
      "recommended_action": "Name these fields as declarations, or compute and check a basis for a bound source matrix before using them as mathematical rank or repair-space evidence."
    },
    {
      "id": "RLA-F03",
      "statement": "The semiring multiplication budget named MAX_SCALAR_OPERATIONS counts one unit per dot-product term although the body calls both mul and add. An admitted256-square multiplication therefore performs2^25 such scalar calls against the named2^24 limit.",
