      "recommended_action": "Rename the limit as a dot-product-term bound, or count both scalar calls consistently with the checked BasicMatrix owner and document per-call versus whole-power accounting."
    },
    {
      "id": "RLA-F04",
      "statement": "Empty-axis matrix helpers weaken their stated shape/index contract: row(2x0,99) and column(0x2,99) return an empty vector because no indexed element is visited; to_rows followed by from_rows turns0x3 into0x0 despite inverse wording.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "path": "code/rust/core_linear_algebra/src/exact_field/matrix.rs",
          "sha256": "79c9c4419985b585bb27c0b2429a1689b51d3a7ba180afef840111a9dc713871",
